{"seq":2,"slug":"mod-api-design","title":"Mod API 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/extension/mod-api-design","wordCount":1467,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"mod-api-设计\">Mod API 设计</h1><p>沙箱决定了 mod 能不能跑，API 决定了 mod 能干什么。它是你的引擎与成千上万陌生作者之间唯一的合同——而且是一份你单方面起草、却很难单方面修改的合同。一旦某个函数被一百个热门 mod 用上，你就再也不敢删它。Mod API 设计的全部难处，都在「给足能力」与「保住改动自由」这对矛盾里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Mod API 与普通内部接口的根本区别是「契约不可回收」。内部接口你随时能改、改完全员重构；mod API 一旦发布，调用方是你管不到的第三方，破坏它就是破坏整个社区的存量内容。因此 mod API 设计的第一原则不是「好用」，而是「能稳定地演进」。围绕这个原则，有四根支柱：暴露面最小化、版本契约、事件驱动、能力分级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[引擎内核] --&gt; B[API 层&lt;br/&gt;稳定契约]&#10;    B --&gt; C[查询 API&lt;br/&gt;读游戏状态]&#10;    B --&gt; D[命令 API&lt;br/&gt;改游戏状态]&#10;    B --&gt; E[事件 API&lt;br/&gt;订阅生命周期]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Mod 代码]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[通过句柄/事件交互]&#10;    G --&gt; A&#10;    B --&gt; H[版本号&lt;br/&gt;semver 契约]&#10;    H --&gt; I[兼容性检查]\">flowchart TD\n    A[引擎内核] --&gt; B[API 层&lt;br/&gt;稳定契约]\n    B --&gt; C[查询 API&lt;br/&gt;读游戏状态]\n    B --&gt; D[命令 API&lt;br/&gt;改游戏状态]\n    B --&gt; E[事件 API&lt;br/&gt;订阅生命周期]\n    C --&gt; F[Mod 代码]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[通过句柄/事件交互]\n    G --&gt; A\n    B --&gt; H[版本号&lt;br/&gt;semver 契约]\n    H --&gt; I[兼容性检查]</pre><p>API 的三类原语——查询、命令、事件——构成 mod 与游戏交互的全部方式。下表对比它们的语义与设计要点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原语</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>设计要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查询（Query）</td>\n<td>mod 读游戏</td>\n<td>无副作用获取状态</td>\n<td>返回快照/句柄，不暴露内部指针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命令（Command）</td>\n<td>mod 改游戏</td>\n<td>有副作用变更状态</td>\n<td>校验合法性，失败可回滚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件（Event）</td>\n<td>游戏通知 mod</td>\n<td>生命周期回调</td>\n<td>稳定的事件名与 payload schema</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"暴露面最小化-每个-api-都是一笔负债\">暴露面最小化：每个 API 都是一笔负债</h2><p>新手最常犯的错是「把内部函数一股脑暴露出去」，以为给的越多 mod 越强。实则每暴露一个函数，你就给自己绑上了一份维护义务——这个函数日后不能随便改签名、不能改语义、出 bug 还得继续支持。一个实用原则是 Rich Hickey 那句「设计是把东西拆开（decomplecting）」的反向应用：API 面应该刚好覆盖 mod 的真实用例，不多一分。</p>\n<p>具体做法是把「内部实现」与「对外契约」彻底隔开，对外只暴露一层薄的稳定门面（facade）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"// 内部实现可以随便改&#10;class EntityManager { /* 内部数据结构、可重构 */ };&#10;&#10;// 对外 API 是稳定门面，永不暴露 EntityManager 本身&#10;namespace modapi {&#10;    EntityHandle SpawnEntity(const char* type);     // 命令&#10;    bool         IsAlive(EntityHandle h);           // 查询&#10;    void         OnEntityKilled(KillCallback cb);   // 事件订阅&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 内部实现可以随便改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EntityManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> /* 内部数据结构、可重构 */</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 对外 API 是稳定门面，永不暴露 EntityManager 本身</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">namespace</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> modapi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    EntityHandle</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SpawnEntity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> char*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // 命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">         IsAlive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">EntityHandle</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // 查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">         OnEntityKilled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">KillCallback</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> cb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 事件订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>mod 只能看见 <code>modapi</code> 命名空间里的句柄和函数，看不见 <code>EntityManager</code>。这样你日后重构 <code>EntityManager</code>，只要门面行为不变，所有 mod 照常工作。这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/moddable-architecture\">可扩展架构</a> 里依赖反转原则在 API 层的落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件驱动-让-mod-在对的时机被叫醒\">事件驱动：让 mod 在对的时机被叫醒</h2><p>mod 大多数时候不是主动轮询，而是被动响应——「玩家死亡时」「关卡加载完成时」播一段逻辑。这要求 API 以事件为中心，让 mod 订阅生命周期钩子。事件 API 的设计难点在于「事件本身也是契约」：事件名、触发时机、payload 字段一旦发布就不能随意变。</p>\n<p>设计良好的事件系统要明确三件事：触发顺序是否确定（多个 mod 订阅同一事件，谁先收到）、payload 是否可被 mod 修改（只读通知还是可拦截）、异常如何隔离（一个 mod 的回调抛错不能阻断其他 mod）。其中「触发顺序」直接牵连到 <a href=\"../ecosystem/mod-dependencies\">依赖与加载顺序</a>——加载顺序往往就决定了事件回调顺序，这是 mod 冲突的常见根源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本契约-用-semver-把破坏性变更说清楚\">版本契约：用 semver 把破坏性变更说清楚</h2><p>mod API 必须有版本号，且语义清晰。业界标准是语义化版本（semver）<code>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</code>：PATCH 修 bug 不改契约，MINOR 向后兼容地加功能，MAJOR 才允许破坏性变更。mod 在清单里声明自己依赖的 API 版本，加载器据此判断兼容性。</p>\n<p>兼容性判定可形式化。设游戏提供 API 版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_g = (M_g, m_g, p_g)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，mod 要求版本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_r = (M_r, m_r, p_r)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，则兼容当且仅当：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_g = M_r \\;\\land\\; m_g \\ge m_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即主版本必须相等（否则有破坏性变更），且游戏的次版本不低于 mod 要求的（保证 mod 用到的功能都存在）。当游戏被迫做破坏性变更（升 MAJOR），存量 mod 会集体失效——如何缓解这种冲击、提供迁移路径，是 <a href=\"../ecosystem/mod-version-compat\">版本兼容</a> 的专题，它与存档的模式演化共享同一套思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能力分级-不是所有-mod-都该拿到所有-api\">能力分级：不是所有 mod 都该拿到所有 API</h2><p>进阶的 API 设计会给 mod 分能力级别，而非一刀切。一个只想改 UI 的 mod 不需要拿到「修改存档」的 API。把 API 按敏感度分组，mod 在清单里声明它需要哪些能力组，玩家安装时可见、可拒。这把 <a href=\"scripting-sandbox\">脚本沙箱</a> 的能力模型从「沙箱内 vs 沙箱外」细化到了「沙箱内的不同权限档」，也为 <a href=\"../practice/mod-security\">Mod 安全与沙箱逃逸</a> 的最小权限原则提供了 API 层抓手——一个被攻陷的 UI mod，拿不到它从没申请过的存档写权限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>mod API 是不可回收的契约，调用方是你管不到的第三方，破坏它即破坏社区存量内容，故首要原则是「能稳定演进」而非「好用」。</li>\n<li>三类原语：查询（读、无副作用）、命令（写、可回滚）、事件（生命周期回调）；事件名与 payload 也是契约。</li>\n<li>暴露面最小化：每个对外函数都是维护负债，用薄门面隔开内部实现，重构内部不破坏 mod。</li>\n<li>事件驱动要明确触发顺序、可否修改 payload、异常隔离；触发顺序牵连加载顺序，是冲突常见根源。</li>\n<li>用 semver 管理契约：主版本相等且次版本不低于要求才兼容（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>∧</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_g=M_r \\land m_g \\ge m_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9221em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）；破坏性变更升 MAJOR。</li>\n<li>能力分级让 mod 按需申请权限，被攻陷的 mod 拿不到未申请的能力，是 API 层的最小权限。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>API 暴露什么由架构决定：<a href=\"../foundations/moddable-architecture\">可扩展架构</a></li>\n<li>事件顺序牵连加载顺序：<a href=\"../ecosystem/mod-dependencies\">依赖与加载顺序</a></li>\n<li>破坏性变更的迁移：<a href=\"../ecosystem/mod-version-compat\">版本兼容</a></li>\n<li>跨库：插件扩展点的编辑器侧设计：<a href=\"../../game-tools-editor-development/editor-features/plugin-extensibility\">插件与扩展性</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Mod API 设计","id":"mod-api-设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"暴露面最小化：每个 API 都是一笔负债","id":"暴露面最小化-每个-api-都是一笔负债"},{"level":2,"text":"事件驱动：让 mod 在对的时机被叫醒","id":"事件驱动-让-mod-在对的时机被叫醒"},{"level":2,"text":"版本契约：用 semver 把破坏性变更说清楚","id":"版本契约-用-semver-把破坏性变更说清楚"},{"level":2,"text":"能力分级：不是所有 mod 都该拿到所有 API","id":"能力分级-不是所有-mod-都该拿到所有-api"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"脚本沙箱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/extension/scripting-sandbox"},"next":{"title":"Mod 资产管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-modding-ugc/extension/asset-pipeline-mods"}}